{
  "format": "ta-scenario/1",
  "description": "WarlordEx (CORBATSX, from warlordex.ufo: the Warlord with a spliced midbody, four extra laser turrets on weapons 4..7 and five times the hull) ringed by 40 ARM Skeeters, all of them ordered onto it. Skeeters are the right swarm for this: ARMPT_LASER reaches 180 against CORE_BATSLASER's 810, so they have to come inside the new battery to fight at all \u2014 a fleet of Crusaders (660) simply parks outside it and the four turrets never fire a shot. The rings are ellipses, not circles, because the strait's water runs east-west and a circle of this radius beaches its northern arc. Needs the extra-weapons module armed (tacli arm <inst> weapons.on), warlordex.ufo in the instance gamedir, and the fusions and energy stores on the north shore, because CORE_BATSLASER costs 75 energy a shot and clear_existing takes the commander's storage with it. `scenario load` maps the terrain itself, so the fight is not watched through a black circle.",
